---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
import Star from './Star.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<section id="work" class="section container" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div><p class="eyebrow section-label"><span>01 /</span> WHAT I’M BUILDING</p><h2 id="work-title">Different fields.<br />One <em>direction.</em></h2></div>
    <p>From the software businesses run on to the food we grow. I’m interested in making things that matter.</p>
  </div>
  <article class="featured-work">
    <div class="featured-copy">
      <div class="featured-top"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> BUILDING NOW</span><a class="yc-badge" href={profile.yc} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><b>Y</b> Combinator <Arrow diagonal /></a></div>
      <h3>Minicor</h3>
      <p class="featured-intro">Connecting tomorrow’s AI<br />to the systems we use today.</p>
      <p class="featured-description">We turn legacy desktop workflows into APIs, so AI companies can work with the software their customers already depend on.</p>
      <div class="featured-bottom"><a class="text-link light-link" href={profile.minicor} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Explore Minicor <Arrow diagonal /></a><span class="eyebrow">CO-FOUNDER & CTO</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="system-illustration" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="illustration-grid"></div>
      <span class="diagram-label label-top">INTELLIGENCE → EXECUTION</span>
      <div class="diagram-input"><span class="tiny-label">INPUT</span><span class="code-mark">{`{ }`}</span><span>AI & APIs</span></div>
      <div class="diagram-wire wire-one"></div>
      <div class="diagram-core"><Star /><span>minicor</span></div>
      <div class="diagram-wire wire-two"></div>
      <div class="diagram-window"><div class="window-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="window-body"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>Legacy systems</b></div></div>
      <span class="diagram-label label-bottom"><i class="status-dot"></i> MAKING THE CONNECTION.</span>
    </div>
  </article>
  <div class="venture-grid">
    <article class="venture-card">
      <div class="venture-art lottery-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ticket"><span>LUCKY START</span><div class="ticket-star">✳</div><span class="ticket-bottom">AN EARLIER CHAPTER <span>№ 001</span></span></div></div>
      <div class="venture-info"><p class="eyebrow">ENTREPRENEURSHIP / PREVIOUSLY</p><h3>Lucky Start</h3><p>A lottery company I launched. An earlier chapter in my journey of turning ideas into businesses.</p></div>
    </article>
    <article class="venture-card">
      <div class="venture-art palm-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="land-size">18<span>hectares</span></span><svg viewBox="0 0 300 180" fill="none"><path d="M170 180c-3-40-1-69 9-107M181 79c-34-13-52-7-73 7m72-8c-20-28-44-37-70-33m73 32c1-37-15-57-34-65m36 65c26-30 53-35 78-29m-77 33c28-9 51-5 67 12m-69-18c22-12 29-29 28-48" /><path class="field-line" d="M0 138c68-30 89 40 160 14s107-19 140-1M0 160c68-30 89 40 160 14s107-19 140-1" /></svg></div>
      <div class="venture-info"><p class="eyebrow">AGRICULTURE / OWNER</p><h3>Oil palm plantation</h3><p>Eighteen hectares of oil palm. Building in agriculture and investing in the capacity to produce.</p></div>
    </article>
    <article class="venture-card">
      <div class="venture-art poultry-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="egg egg-one"></div><div class="egg egg-two"></div><div class="egg egg-three"></div><span class="eyebrow">GROWING SOMETHING TANGIBLE.</span></div>
      <div class="venture-info"><p class="eyebrow">FOOD PRODUCTION / OWNER</p><h3>Layer poultry farm</h3><p>A layer chicken farm focused on egg production. Another way of building something useful, from the ground up.</p></div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
